1. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS REDISTRIBUTED INSIDE THIS SOLUTION
================================================================================

Two web resources in the managed solution are build products that embed
third-party code and assets, and therefore redistribute them:

  * asx_ruleeditor.js  - the Rule Builder bundle (React + Fluent UI v9 and their
                         transitive dependencies, bundled by esbuild).
  * asx_editor.css     - the font/boot-shell web resource, which base64-embeds the
                         Manrope variable font.

The plugin assembly (AscentixRulesEnginePlugin.dll) and the remaining web
resources (asx_rulesengine.js, asx_authoringforms.js, the HTML shells, the table
icons) contain no third-party code; see section 2.

